--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Licensor may publish future versions of WinTool under different terms,
including more permissive ones. Doing so does not affect the rights You have
already received in any version published under these terms, which remain
governed by them.

You may not apply the terms of a future version to a version published under
these terms.

